Sonic the Hedgehog is a action, science fiction,
comedy film directed by Jeff Fowler.

3
00:10:14,482 --> 00:10:20,482
Powered with incredible speed, Sonic The Hedgehog
embraces his new home on Earth.

4
00:13:39,310 --> 00:13:45,310
That is, until Sonic sparks the attention of super-uncool evil genius Dr.

5
00:17:04,137 --> 00:17:10,137
Now it’s super-villain vs.

6
00:20:28,965 --> 00:20:34,965
super-sonic in an all-out race across the globe to stop Robotnik
from using Sonic’s unique power for world domination.

7
00:23:53,793 --> 00:23:59,793
Sonic (voice), played by Ben Schwartz.

8
